OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CSaturday:FSaturday will be an          
OL,6,Funsettled day. It will be cloudy and   
OL,7,Fbreezy with outbreaks of rain, some of 
OL,8,Fwhich will be heavy, especially around 
OL,9,Fthe middle of the day.                 
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA much  
OL,12,Fbrighter day is expected on Sunday,    
OL,13,Fthough some blustery showers could     
OL,14,Fdevelop. It will turn more unsettled   
OL,15,Fagain early next week, with strong     
OL,16,Fwinds and some rain likely.            
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
